Thanks to Brian Ripley, Michael Bramley, and Sam Buttrey for prompt
replies.  My question:

> Dear Snews folks:
>
> I would like to change the names of the element of a tree object that
> are plotted with text.tree().  I havetried changing all the attributes
> of mytree$terms in vain (e.g. term.labels, variables, etc.).  Where does
